        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About this product",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Most sunscreens feel heavy in our heat, and most anti-aging creams are made for night.</p><p>This does the morning in one step: broad-spectrum SPF 30 from six UV filters, Bakuchiol and Niacinamide, on a beef tallow base with Zinc PCA and silica for a matte finish. No white cast.</p>",
            "open": true,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>1. Every morning, on clean, dry skin, apply about a quarter teaspoon to the face and neck.</p><p>2. Massage until absorbed, 15 minutes before heading out.</p><p>3. Reapply every 2 hours when you are outdoors or sweating.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_3": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Key ingredients: six UV filters including Tinosorb M and Tinosorb S, Bakuchiol, Niacinamide, beef tallow, Zinc PCA, silica, Sodium Hyaluronate.</p><p>Full ingredient list:<br>Water, Isohexadecane, Methylene Bis-Benzotriazolyl Tetramethylbutylphenol, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Phenylbenzimidazole Sulfonic Acid, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Butylene Glycol, Homosalate, Cetearyl Olivate, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Niacinamide, Aminomethyl Propanol, Adeps Bovis, Polysorbate 60, Cetearyl Glucoside, Silica, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Bakuchiol, Zinc PCA, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Oryza Sativa Extract, Phragmites Communis Extract, Zea Mays Silk Extract, Malva Sylvestris Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Extract, Stephania Tetrandra Extract, Taraxacum Officinale Extract, Saururus Chinensis Extract, Xanthan Gum, Sodium Hyaluronate, Disodium EDTA.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_4": {
