    "faq": {
      "type": "zenith-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will this work even if I've never used sunscreen with anti-aging before?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 is specifically designed for Filipino men who are new to comprehensive daytime protection. Our lightweight formula is engineered to work with your skin’s natural processes, making it perfect for beginners. You’ll get professional protection and anti-aging results even if this is your first SPF product.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Hindi ba ito magiging white cast or greasy sa face? Ayoko kasing parang typical sunscreen yung feeling.",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all! We’ve specially formulated the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 for the Philippine climate with zero white cast technology.</p><p>Unlike heavy sunscreens, the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 absorbs instantly with a natural matte finish. It’s lightweight enough for daily use but powerful enough to give real protection and anti-aging results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use this if I have sensitive skin?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! Beef tallow actually matches your skin’s natural oils, making the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 ideal for sensitive skin.</p><p>Our formula uses bakuchiol instead of harsh retinol and botanical extracts that are perfect for sensitive skin that still needs strong sun protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long will one tube last?",
            "answer": "<p>One 50g tube of the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 typically lasts 30 days when used as directed (once daily). You only need a quarter-teaspoon amount for full face and neck coverage, making it excellent value for comprehensive protection.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I use this with my other products like cleanser and night cream?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes! The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 works perfectly as your final morning step. For complete anti-aging care, start with Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cleanser, then apply the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 for protection. At night, use Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Cream for maximum repair and renewal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Bakit mas mahal compared sa ibang sunscreen sa mall?",
            "answer": "<p>While the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 costs more upfront, you’re getting premium tallow, advanced 6-filter UV protection, and concentrated anti-aging actives in one product.</p><p>Most mall sunscreens only offer basic protection with white cast and greasy feel, requiring you to buy separate moisturizer and anti-aging products that don’t work safely under sun.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "When will I see results?",
            "answer": "<p>Sun protection and comfort from the first use with the Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30.</p><p>That’s why we offer the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee – we’re confident you’ll see real protection and anti-aging results.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
